Affirmative efforts.</span></b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>  Affirmative efforts means making vigorous attempts in
good faith to contact and contract with certified businesses. (Ord. 11032 § 11
(part), 1993).</span></p>

